Lexifina's own work in this repository (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The texts are not Lexifina's. Each source keeps its own terms:

- ADGM Courts judgments: published by the Courts of Abu Dhabi Global Market at
  https://www.adgm.com/adgm-courts/judgments (PDFs on assets.adgm.com). Court judgments are official documents
  excluded from copyright protection by UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 38 of 2021 on Copyrights and Neighboring Rights,
  art. 3(2) ("الأحكام القضائية"); this record relies on that exemption and takes each judgment's own text only.
  Source credited: ADGM Courts, Abu Dhabi Global Market.

This repository is not an official publication; the court's published judgment prevails.
